THE LOAD-BEARING CHECK. 68 of the 94 labels ARE 0006's labels, which invites a
survivorship reading -- the survivors are 0006's sample filtered by survival.
The 26 fresh situations exist to close that hole and are drawn from a
population that has changed by ~600 situations. Carried reads 30.9% useful;
fresh reads 30.8%. They agree to a tenth of a point on the figure the band is
written against. One draw of 26 has a wide interval, and no A/B was run, so
this is evidence against the objection rather than proof, and no fix is
attributed.

